abstract: "Closed-loop (MAPE-K) pipeline that detects six fault classes on AWS EC2 from Prometheus metrics and remediates them with Ansible or Terraform. Software artefact of the MSc thesis 'Automated Self-Healing Cloud Infrastructure: An Empirical Study of Observability-Triggered Terraform and Ansible Remediation on AWS EC2'."
